From 8dbdaf516cbc03f98409f22fa123acd95051b2b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NekoSuneVR <grantrobinson100@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:07:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(android): crossplay lobby chat and roster for 4.3.10
 clients

- answer PhotonGameJoin on the comm server (actor id, CmuneRoomID, ClearLevel)
- ClientCommCenter (network id 4): JoinCommServer, roster, lobby chat
- server -> client calls use event code 0 (the only code the client treats as RPC)
- chat from Android: actor id is ignored, identity from the connection, relayed as
  'Name [Android]' with CMID 0 when EnableLegacyGuestChat is on
- PC lobby chat on the same comm server now reaches Android players too
- Android players appear in the PC roster and PC players in the Android roster
- LegacySerialization: RoomData, RoomId, SyncObject/CommActorInfo, lists, Vector3/Quaternion
- smoke tests for the new types; protocol docs updated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U5G7hXb6tWbughHAPUXrrJ
